# What UNIX tools do I know

- (neo)vim: my favorite text editor
- zsh: default shell
- tmux: shell multiplexer
- git: reflog saved my life
- go: because I am also a Go developer
- fzf: navigate trough shell command history and filesystem
- z: powerfull filesystem navigator
- fd: to quickly find file/directories (faster than find)
- ag: because grep is too slow
- jq/yq: wrestling with json and yaml
- gpg: crypto stuff
- keybase: be social in the crypto space
- kubectl: all purpose Kubernetes CLI
- kubectx/kubens: more k8s CLIs
- helm: because I have to manage k8s applications
- flux: doing Kubernetes the GitOps way
- gh/hub and Copilot: hard to avoid Github

